### ============================================================
### PEDIDO 5 - CASH INVALIDO / CANCELADO POR EMPLOYEE
### ============================================================

### 5.1 CUSTOMER crea Pedido 5
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "tableNumber": 5,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 28,
      "quantity": 2,
      "notes": "Pedido que se cancelara por cash invalido"
    },
    {
      "productId": 9,
      "quantity": 1,
      "notes": "Bebida energetica"
    }
  ]
}


### 5.2 CUSTOMER intenta pagar Pedido 5 con efectivo insuficiente
### Resultado esperado: 400 Bad Request.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/cash/request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "orderId": {{order5Id}},
  "cashReceived": 1.00
}


### 5.3 EMPLOYEE cancela Pedido 5 porque el pago no se completa
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{order5Id}}/cancel
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### 5.4 CUSTOMER consulta Pedido 5 cancelado
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{order5Id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 5.5 CUSTOMER intenta descargar ticket del Pedido 5 cancelado
### Resultado esperado: error porque no hay pago completado.
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/ticket/{{order5Id}}
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


