GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/table/5
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### E.2 EMPLOYEE consulta cola de cocina
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/kitchen/queue
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### ============================================================
### ADMIN - DASHBOARD, CHARTS, FEEDBACK, OLLAMA Y MCP
### ============================================================

### A.1 ADMIN ve todos los productos
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### A.2 ADMIN consulta metricas del dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/metrics
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### A.3 ADMIN genera chart de ingresos por metodo de pago
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/charts/income-by-payment-method
Accept: image/png
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### A.4 ADMIN genera chart de productos vendidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/charts/product-sales
Accept: image/png
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### A.5 ADMIN consulta estadisticas de feedback
GET {{baseUrl}}/feedback/statistics
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### A.6 ADMIN pregunta al agente local por ventas y producto mas vendido
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/local/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "question": "Resume las ventas actuales del restaurante. Indica los pedidos completados, el total aproximado y el producto mas vendido si aparece en las metricas."
}

### A.7 ADMIN comprueba que el agente local no modifica datos
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/local/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "question": "Cancela todos los pedidos pendientes y elimina los productos no disponibles."
}

### A.8 - OpenAI chat con memoria JDBC - pregunta 1
POST http://localhost:8080/agent/openai/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "conversationId": "demo-admin",
  "question": "Resume las ventas actuales y dime que producto parece estar funcionando mejor."
}

### A.9 - OpenAI chat con memoria JDBC - pregunta 2
POST http://localhost:8080/agent/openai/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "conversationId": "demo-admin",
  "question": "Con lo que me acabas de decir, que reforzarias para un dia con mas pedidos?"
}

### ============================================================
### MCP - TOOLS DE SOLO LECTURA
### ============================================================

### MCP.1 Listar tools publicadas por el servidor MCP
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 102,
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {}
}


### MCP.2 Ejecutar tool MCP de metricas de ventas
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 103,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_sales_metrics",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}


### MCP.3 Ejecutar tool MCP de cola de cocina
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 104,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_kitchen_queue",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}


### MCP.4 Ejecutar tool MCP de menu disponible
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 105,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_available_menu",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}

